# MPS editor — Cursor-compatible agent rules

These rules are loaded alongside `.voidrules` and Settings → AI instructions.

## Agent behavior

- Be conversational: short, natural progress updates while you work.
- Implement end-to-end with tools; do not stop at plans unless asked.
- Edits apply live in the editor (green/red highlights). User accepts or rejects when done.
- Run build/test/lint when relevant and fix obvious failures.

## Code quality

- Match existing patterns in this Void/VS Code fork.
- Prefer minimal, focused diffs.
